{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12960","headline":"寒夜溪行舟中作 · 独孤及","name":"寒夜溪行舟中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日沈诸山昏，寂历羣动宿。\n孤舟独不系，风水夜相逐。\n云归恒星白，霜下天地肃。\n月轮大如盘，金波入空谷。\n魏阙万里道，羇念千虑束。\n倦飞思故巢，敢望桐与竹。\n沈吟登楼赋，中夜起三复。\n忧来无良方，归候春酒熟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12960.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12960","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}